---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Company">
  <main class="site-main">
    <div class="company-page">
      <div class="container container--wide">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="title2"><h2>Our Story</h2></div>
          <h1 class="title">About Us</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">Serving the Arizona Valley since 1975.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="company-content">
          <p>The story of Southwest Sweeper Sales is rooted in hard work, determination, and a commitment to the sweeping industry.</p>

          <p>Our company’s roots began with the immigration of our founder from the Greek island of Chios to Arizona in the 1970s. With little more than ambition and a strong work ethic, he started a small service business using a push broom and shovel to build a customer base. Through perseverance and a willingness to take on every challenge, the business continued to grow and eventually expanded into the contract sweeping industry.</p>

          <p>Over the years, the company grew into a successful operation with a large fleet of sweeping equipment. After decades in the industry, the decision was made to move in a new direction.</p>

          <p>In 2000, Southwest Sweeper Sales was established with a simple idea: use decades of experience in the sweeping business to help others find the right equipment and support it for years to come. What began as a small venture quickly developed into a thriving business serving customers throughout the United States and internationally.</p>

          <p>Today, Southwest Sweeper Sales represents multiple leading equipment manufacturers and provides sales, parts, service, and support for a wide range of sweeping equipment. Our full-service capabilities, experienced staff, and extensive parts inventory allow us to support our customers long after the sale.</p>

          <p>Now, the next generation of the family is carrying that tradition forward, continuing the family’s commitment to hard work, integrity, personal service, and the sweeping industry.</p>

          <p>While the business continues to grow and evolve, the principles that started it all remain the same: work hard, take care of your customers, stand behind your products, and build something that can be passed on to the next generation.</p>

          <p>Southwest Sweeper Sales — built on experience, carried forward by the next generation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .company-page {
    padding-top: 8rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .company-content {
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .company-content p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
